{"unit_id":"grunmin__dsh-acp-enhanced#card-zh","repo":"grunmin/dsh-acp-enhanced","commit":"2790ead7969744b82152ced27e242118be87267c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-acp-enhanced 是面向 Zed 等 ACP 编辑器的 DSH 桥接插件，通过 ACP 标准输入输出连接 DSH agent。它支持流式回复、用量与工具调用遥测、模型和推理强度切换、权限模式及 agent preset 控制，也能恢复和列出持久化会话，并接入 MCP 服务。适合希望在编辑器中使用 DSH 编程会话并查看运行状态的用户。模型提供方和模型可按需配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2630-2740","lib/index.js:2130-2170","lib/index.js:1308-1335","cordis.patch.yml:20-22"]}
{"unit_id":"grunmin__dsh-acp-enhanced#card-en","repo":"grunmin/dsh-acp-enhanced","commit":"2790ead7969744b82152ced27e242118be87267c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-acp-enhanced connects DSH to ACP editors such as Zed. It streams replies and reports usage and tool activity. Users can switch models, reasoning effort, permission modes, and agent presets per session. It also restores saved sessions and connects MCP servers for editor based DSH coding.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:2630-2740","lib/index.js:2130-2170","lib/index.js:1308-1335","cordis.patch.yml:20-22"]}
